# SEO & agent-searchability watch (website ADR-2010) — consumed by the agentbox
# [program:seo-watch-cron] supercronic service. Editable live: supercronic
# re-reads this file from the workspace mount; no image rebuild needed.
#
# 05:40 UTC nightly: after the dream window (01:00–05:00), the forum backup
# (03:10) and the diagram review (05:17), so the browser sidecar and the Z.AI
# budget are not shared with another nightly job. flock makes an overlong run
# skip the next slot rather than overlap it; timeout (90 min) bounds the whole
# night: GLM at max reasoning effort alone may take up to 30 min.
40 5 * * * mkdir -p /home/devuser/workspace/.agentbox/seo-watch && cd /home/devuser/workspace/dreamlab-ai-website && flock -n /home/devuser/workspace/.agentbox/seo-watch/.lock timeout 5400 node scripts/seo-watch/run.mjs nightly 2>&1

# Inbox watch (contact form, email signup, Talk-to-AI chat → Nostr): 07:15 UTC,
# after the seo-watch window, so the digest is waiting in Amethyst in the morning.
# Reads the monitor-key copies of every submission, probes the relay round trip,
# checks whitelist + deployed bundle, and DMs the operator only when there is
# something new or something broken. State: .agentbox/inbox-watch/.
15 7 * * * mkdir -p /home/devuser/workspace/.agentbox/inbox-watch && cd /home/devuser/workspace/dreamlab-ai-website && flock -n /home/devuser/workspace/.agentbox/inbox-watch/.lock timeout 300 node scripts/inbox-watch/run.mjs >> /home/devuser/workspace/.agentbox/inbox-watch/cron.log 2>&1
